laude -p`; tests â†’ `tests/stub_gandalf.py`).\n\n- **Locked decision 2 â€” input** â€” Point Gandalf at the project FOLDER: `cwd=<folder>` + `--add-dir <folder>` (resolves MAJOR S1-5), under a Gandalf-specific timeout `ANCHOR_GANDALF_TIMEOUT` (default ~600s, not summarizer's 60s); honest degraded run on timeout, never a hang.\n\n- **Locked decision 3 â€” output** â€” Full run writes artifacts at the PROJECT ROOT under `<folder>/gandalf/run-<ts>/`: `report.md`, `exec-summary.md`, `advisor-output.json` â€” served by the existing `/artifact` route (never under `.anchor`, which `/artifact` rejects). Internal index at `.anchor/projects/<id>/gandalf/index.json` (read by the GET endpoint, never served). `gandalf/` added to project `.gitignore` (best-effort). One-line verdict = cleaned top-level `verdict` field stored in the index.\n\n- **Locked decision 4 â€” cadence** â€” First scan + manual. First-run auto-fire via a new `_trigger_gandalf(...)` mirroring `_trigger_project_summary` exactly (module flag `_PROACTIVE_SUMMARY_ENABLED` off in tests, env snapshot forwarded, daemon thread, never blocks render). First-run-ONLY via `run_gandalf_if_absent` guarded by a per-project in-process lock (check-and-set before scheduling â€” resolves TOCTOU double-fire S3-4). The manual `POST /api/rnd/gandalf_run` endpoint is NOT module-flag-gated.\n\n- **Locked decision 5 â€” UI** â€” A right-column \"Gandalf\" tab ABOVE Grass (order: Gandalf â†’ Grass â†’ Deliverables). Run history newest-first; each row = verdict + timestamp + degraded/cross_model chip; click expands exec-summary inline (cockpit accordion, no page bounce); `[Full report]`/`[raw JSON]` open via `/artifact`. Honest degraded/error rows and an empty state. New white-wizard icon `vendor/brand/gandalf-white-icon.svg` (Gandalf the White, not GWL green), in `dist_manifest.txt`.\n\n- **Locked decision 6** â€” Re-runnable any time; each run a new timestamped entry; history accumulates newest-first.\n\n- **New module** â€” `gandalf.py` (stdlib only, in manifest): `run_gandalf` (build prompt â†’ launch â†’ extract text â†’ locate last balanced top-level JSON â†’ validate schema contract [9 required top-level keys + per-item keys, S3-3] â†’ render artifacts â†’ append SAFE index record under `paths.WRITE_LOCK`, always `degraded:true`; failures recorded as honest error runs, never raises), `run_gandalf_if_absent`, `list_runs` (newest-first SAFE projections, no absolute paths), `get_run`, render helpers. Index stamped with `GANDALF_INDEX_SCHEMA_VERSION` (older versions normalized).\n\n- **Reuse unchanged** â€” `job_runner` (launch/`extract_assistant_text`/`wait`), `report_viewer` (`/artifact`), `paths.WRITE_LOCK`, `/vendor/brand/`, `summarizer.short_summary_text`.\n\n- **PROJECT DONE wave** â€” `anchor.py`: `rnd gandalf <pid>` read-only mirror (no mutating CLI form). `anchor_healthcheck.check_gandalf_surface` fully stubbed (stub_gandalf + temp dirs + proactive summary off; run â†’ 3 artifacts + index â†’ list_runs â†’ re-run appends â†’ degraded run honest; restores env, registered after `check_rnd_v12_surface`, never binds `:8777`). `distro.py` manifest + SVG; CLAUDE.md + SESSION-HANDOFF.md updated. **Live-smoke (manual, not a pytest gate):** one real `claude -p` Gandalf run must emit parseable schema within the timeout before prod-done (deploy-checklist item).\n\n- **Risks mitigated** â€” R1 schema fragility (last-balanced-JSON + validate â†’ honest error), R2 first-scan cost (first-run-only + daemon + flag-gated + timeout), R3 render-path blocking (reads index.json only), R4 same-model honesty (degraded/cross_model chips), R5 artifact serving (project-root only), R6 double first-scan (per-project lock + skip-if-running + atomic index writes; test asserts â‰¤1 run), R7 token-auth/traversal (endpoints token-authed; artifacts via `/artifact` only).\n\n- **Out of scope (v2)** â€” Full Node-seam Gandalf rigor, cross-model substrate, auto-run on every rescan, global cross-project view, run diffing,